    snakemake --profile workflow/profiles/default -s workflow/cloe/Snakefile -j 192 cloe_all

``configfile:`` below names the UNIONS v2 x LSx recipe and its chains; a
``--configfile`` of your own overrides it (targets go before ``--configfile``).
"""

